OL,3,AWhy the charts are full of old songs -
OL,4,Aand so are your playlists
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore music is being created than at any
OL,7,Fother time in human history. Every day,
OL,8,Fmore than 100,000 songs are being
OL,9,Fsubmitted to streaming services.
OL,11,FAnd despite the deluge of AI music -
OL,12,FSpotify says it has removed 75 million
OL,13,F"spammy tracks" from its catalogue -
OL,14,Freal music still makes up most of our
OL,15,Flistening. The streaming service Deezer
OL,16,Fsays AI accounts for just 0.5% of
OL,17,Fstreams on its platform.
OL,19,FThe problem for all those artists
OL,20,Fcreating new music is that our
OL,21,Flistening habits increasingly show a
OL,22,Flove for nostalgia.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
