OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASpotify uploads lyrics for Dolly
OL,4,AParton's Welsh version of Jolene in
OL,5,AIrish
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpotify removed the Irish lyrics after
OL,8,Fthe BBC approached it for comment.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
